  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Qin Ding Ling hands Fang Yuan a second Immortal Gu after Human Qi Immortal Gu. Narration names it Earth Qi Immortal Gu and groups it with Human Qi and Heaven Qi Immortal Gu as the three Immortal Gu for Triple Qi Retraction, treated as Heavenly Court treasures limited to members. Fang Yuan holds Human Qi in one hand and Earth Qi in the other and praises both before Heaven Qi is shown. In his assessment the three cores cannot be replaced by other qi path Immortal Gu without a sharp drop in Triple Qi Retraction’s battle value.",
        "chapters": [
          2025
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qin_ding_ling",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_human_qi_immortal_gu",
          "sys_human_qi",
          "gu_heaven_qi_immortal_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "move_triple_qi_retraction",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "sys_heaven_qi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Earth qi as the golden ground-side resource, separate from this Gu, is covered on earth qi.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_earth_qi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the qi harvest fruit is gone and Qi Sea Ancestor presses for payment, Qin Ding Ling gives heaven qi and earth qi Immortal Gu but keeps Human Qi Immortal Gu as Heavenly Court’s bottom line and as bait for Triple Qi Retraction.",
        "chapters": [
          2037
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "permanent-transfer",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Star Constellation Immortal Venerable suppresses Qi Sea Ancestor in Heavenly Court, Heaven Qi Immortal Gu leaves his immortal aperture first, then Earth Qi Immortal Gu and other qi path Immortal Gu, held for Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable.",
        "chapters": [
          2327
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aperture-seizure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
